stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> FreshFront
    FreshFront --> NormalForward: trusted forward safe
    FreshFront --> OrdinaryAvoidance: blocked outside episode
    OrdinaryAvoidance --> FreshFront: bounded 35 degree turn
    OrdinaryAvoidance --> EpisodeScan: boxed or stuck evidence
    EpisodeScan --> EpisodeTurn: fresh valid committed side and remaining budget
    EpisodeTurn --> EpisodeFront: stop after started 25 degree attempt
    EpisodeFront --> EpisodeSide: front blocked and fewer than six attempts
    EpisodeSide --> EpisodeTurn: fresh committed side safe
    EpisodeFront --> ForwardValidation: front at least 30 cm or OPEN and IR clear
    ForwardValidation --> FreshFront: 5000 ms continued trusted forward progress resets episode
    ForwardValidation --> EpisodeFront: immediate re-block preserves budget
    EpisodeFront --> AssistanceHold: exhausted or unsafe
    AssistanceHold --> EpisodeFront: stationary fresh check after cooldown
    EpisodeTurn --> IrBackoff: IR interrupt
    IrBackoff --> EpisodeFront: bounded pulse ends, episode pulses at most five
    EpisodeTurn --> SonarReacquire: fault or stale, stop
    IrBackoff --> SonarReacquire: fault or stale, stop
    SonarReacquire --> EpisodeFront: two new trusted samples and episode retained
    SonarReacquire --> FreshFront: two trusted samples outside episode
    EpisodeTurn --> HazardHold: stop and preserve budgets
    HazardHold --> EnvironmentalScan: stable clear, fresh L/F/R
    EnvironmentalScan --> EpisodeFront: complete trusted scan, remaining budgets
    EnvironmentalScan --> SonarReacquire: temporary fault, intent retained
    SonarReacquire --> EnvironmentalScan: incomplete environment job, restart all evidence
    SonarReacquire --> AssistanceHold: trapped episode retains cooldown
    EpisodeTurn --> OperatorStop: STOP
    OperatorStop --> FreshFront: explicit mode restart resets episode
